  // multiplier is per output channel (dim=1), so we need to broadcast multiplier from [6x1x1] to [6x6x5x5]
  // The multiplier shape corresponds to [out_channels=6, 1, 1], but conv output shape is [batch=6, out_channels=6, 5, 5]
  // The batch dimension is 0, feature dimension is 1, spatial dims 2,3
  // We want to broadcast multiplier on dims [1,2,3] with multiplier dims [0,1,2] mapped to [1,2,3] of output
  // So broadcast multiplier from [6x1x1] to [6x6x5x5] with broadcast dims [1,2,3]
  %mult_broadcast = stablehlo.broadcast_in_dim %arg0 : tensor<6x1x1xf32> to tensor<6x6x5x5xf32> broadcast_dimensions = [1, 2, 3]

