  // lhs = input, rhs = weight, but weight shape must be [in_channels, out_channels, ...] for conv
  // Our weight is [3,16,3,3,3], but conv expects rhs shape [out_channels, in_channels, ...]
  // So we must reshape or transpose weight to [16,3,3,3,3] for conv.
  // Then use lhs_dilation = stride (2,2,2) to simulate transpose conv.
  // Padding is 1 on each side.

