  // So broadcast gn.weight and gn.bias to [1,16,1] then broadcast to [16,16,1]
  // But since batch=16, channels=16, groups=16, channels_per_group=1, and gn.weight shape is [16]
  // We broadcast gn.weight over batch and channels_per_group dims
