I see the error is about the empty array attribute in broadcast_in_dim for scalars. The broadcast_dimensions attribute must be an array of integers with length equal to the rank of the operand. The scalar has rank 0, so the array must be empty, but the syntax requires array<i64: > to be array<i64: > with no elements. The previous code had array<i64: > which is invalid syntax.

The correct syntax for an empty array attribute is array<i64: > with no elements inside. So I will fix that by writing array<i64: > with no elements inside the angle brackets.

