  // Contracting dims: input dim 1 with weight dim 1 (weight is 7x7, but we want W^T)
  // So we transpose weight to 7x7 (same shape), but we want to contract input dim 1 with weight dim 0
  // So dot_general with lhs batch dims = [0], contracting dims = [(1,0)]
  // Result shape: (6x7)
